/E (AI-powered plant disease detection systems offer a transformative solution to modern agricultural challenges. By leveraging advanced technologies such as machine learning, computer vision, and deep learning, these systems enable early, accurate, and cost-effective identification of plant diseases. This leads to timely intervention, reduced crop loss, and improved yield quality, ultimately enhancing food security and sustainability. As AI continues to evolve, integrating it with IoT devices, drones, and mobile platforms will further expand its accessibility and impact.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
